    LLM: 'Game: War. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "War is a simple children's card game. 2 players. 52-card deck split evenly. Both flip top card simultaneously — higher wins both. Tie = 'War': each plays 1 face-down then 1 face-up; higher face-up wins all. Continue until one player has all cards. Pure luck — no decisions.",
    objective: "Win all 52 cards by capturing the opponent's cards through comparison; the player who ends up with all the cards wins.",
    gameplay: 'Both flip top card. Higher wins both (placed at bottom). Tie = War: 1 face-down then 1 face-up each. Higher face-up wins all cards in the war. Multiple wars possible. Insufficient cards during war = lose.',
